#: src/webenginepage.cpp:224
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>To display the requested web page again, the browser needs to resend "
"information you have previously submitted.</p><p>If you were shopping online "
"and made a purchase, click the Cancel button to prevent a duplicate purchase."
"Otherwise, click the Continue button to display the webpage again.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>P'amosar de nueves la páxina web solcitada, el restolador precisa "
"reunviar la información qu'unviesti enantes.</p><p>Si tabes nuna tienda en "
"llinia y ficiesti una merca, calca nel botón Encaboxar pa evitar una merca "
"duplicada. D'otramiente, calca nel botón Siguir p'amosar la páxina web de "
"nueves.</p>"

